-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope and third-party components

This licence covers the code written for this study (the `cod` package, the
experiment drivers, analysis and helper scripts, and the tools/ helpers).

* tep-studio (revised Tennessee Eastman simulator) is NOT included. It is
  installed from PyPI as a dependency; its wrapper code is distributed under
  the BSD-3-Clause licence and the revised TEP model it bundles keeps its
  original authors' terms.
* safetep-core, the public harness that accompanies Alhazmi (2026), is NOT
  included or redistributed (it carries no licence). The bounded supervisory
  interface, validator and the yA anti-windup fix in `cod/` are our own
  implementations following the published description; the 13 anchor
  scenarios and the 5 "frontier" scenarios are re-encoded as scenario
  definitions (data, not code) from the scenario library published with it.
* Language-model weights are not included; they are pulled by Ollama under
  their respective licences.
